  "ops.derivedFromObservationNo": "Derived from observation, no operator data: an event occurs when at least {GROUP_MIN} vehicles of one operator appear (deployment) or disappear (pickup) together within {GROUP_M} m in one collector run. Events up to {GROUP_MERGE_M} m apart are merged into one place. Stored permanently per month (groups/YYYY-MM.json), nothing is deleted.",
